WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
ICE is there because of the dereliction of duty by Biden and the Democrats.

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:12.480
You have black women with MAGA hats on in Chicago, all over the place.

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:14.280
They want the guard to come in.

00:00:14.280 --> 00:00:18.040
There was one woman, she was great today, she said, you know what, I don't care if it's

00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:23.160
a National Guard, the Army, the Marines, the Air Force, I don't care who comes in as long

00:00:23.160 --> 00:00:24.799
as we're safe.

00:00:24.799 --> 00:00:27.580
And that's the way most of the public feels.

00:00:27.580 --> 00:00:29.980
Why don't Democrats want to protect black women?

00:00:29.980 --> 00:00:34.500
First, they didn't stand up for black kids with cancer, now this.

00:00:34.500 --> 00:00:39.900
Jussie Smollett got the benefit of the doubt in Chicago, but not ICE.

00:00:39.900 --> 00:00:44.060
Democrats keep saying this is a civil war, well, Trump's the one trying to liberate black

00:00:44.060 --> 00:00:48.139
Americans, while they're demanding to know who's going to pick their crops.

